The reference symbol is a bed with two pillows, seen from above. In the full drawing, one such bed sits at about (100, 497) in the bedroom labeled 卧室(避难室).

I did not count the furniture near (940, 580) at the right edge, which looks like a different item, or the one at (880, 525), which looks like a desk. That leaves one match.

