The target symbol is a horizontal railing/rod element: a gray frame with a red hatched bar between two small vertical posts. In the drawing, one such element runs along the top at about y=292, from x=55 to beyond x=1000. It is a single continuous instance with posts at x=60, 400 and 740, so it is probably one symbol.

The reference shows a bar with posts at both ends, so the one at the top most likely counts as a single instance. It spans from about x=55 to past 1000. I place its center at about (530, 292).

