The reference shows a horizontal wall section with a red hatched band and small rectangles at both ends. In the full drawing, the only match is the one at about y=292, which runs from the left edge to x≈605. The vertical hatched wall at the right (x≈715, y 668–1000) is a different, vertical element, so I did not count it.

The instance spans roughly x=0 to 605, with its center at about (300, 292).

