The reference shows a monitor/TV-like symbol: a rectangle with an inner rectangle and a stand line. In the drawing, the closest matches are the washing machines near the bottom right (around 872,922 and 942,922), and possibly the appliance at 425,716.

The washing machines at the bottom right look like rounded rectangles with an inner rectangle and a base line, which resembles the reference. Their centers are about (872,922) and (942,922). A partial one at about (990,920) is cut off at the edge. The appliance at (425,716) has a similar look, but it is a different kind of fixture, so I am leaving it out.

