The reference shows a window or door symbol: a horizontal element with blue lines inside a wall opening, with the label "R-TM1821" above it. In the drawing, the matching symbols are the horizontal door openings at the top, one at (463, 73) and one at (678, 73).

The vertical R-TM1621 elements are rotated versions and may also count. The reference shows a horizontal element with wall ends on both sides, and the vertical ones at (356, 160) and (798, 160) are rotated, so I include them. The R-TC1212 windows are different, with multiple parallel lines, so I leave them out.

