The reference symbol shows the Chinese text "贴梁底" (stick to beam bottom) in a box. In the drawing, the text "顶标高贴梁底" appears at the top, around (534, 27). That is one instance.

The text reads "顶标高贴梁底", which contains "贴梁底", so I'm counting it as a match.

