The reference shows a bathtub (a rounded rectangle with a drain and faucet fixtures at the bottom). In the drawing, bathtubs appear at about (646, 905) and (781, 905), below the PC0515d label and to its right.

The bathtub at (646, 905) spans roughly x 610–683 and y 820–990. The second spans roughly x 745–817 and y 820–990, so its center is near (781, 905).

